add('jobstartup','P','What is a common drawback of classic job compute compared with serverless compute for jobs?',[
'Job compute cannot govern data.','Longer startup time from provisioning compute.','It always has a higher total operational cost for every workload.','It does not support Python.'],'B','Classic job compute provision হতে সময় লাগে। Serverless ready capacity দিয়ে startup কমাতে পারে। Total cost workload-dependent, আর classic compute Python support করে।','jobs/run-serverless-jobs','Clarified classic job compute and avoided claiming universally higher operational cost.')
